   "source": [
    "### What is in the epochs object?\n",
    "\n",
    "The epochs are cut around the onset of a near-threshold mechanical stimulus.\n",
    "Every trial carries metadata, most importantly `response_decoded` (did the\n",
    "participant report feeling the stimulus?) and `intensity_level`."
   ]
  },
